[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5221.03, "timestamp": "01:27:01", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5225.51, "timestamp": "01:27:05", "text": "待って、待って、待って、待って。もしも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5228.229, "timestamp": "01:27:08", "text": "コピーしますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5239.59, "timestamp": "01:27:19", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5242.149, "timestamp": "01:27:22", "text": "作成する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5252.95, "timestamp": "01:27:32", "text": "何をしているの？配列オブジェクトを一時停止します。右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5269.83, "timestamp": "01:27:49", "text": "それに、それは間違っている。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5272.55, "timestamp": "01:27:52", "text": "スケジュール。"}]